{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nDetails of the selected process.\n\n## Spec\n- Fields: PID, PPID, user, state, start time, CPU% / MEM, full command line (wrapped), cwd, executable path, children (pid + name), listening ports (from the ports pane's data)\n- Environment variables are **not** shown\n- Values that need privileges (cwd/exe of other users' processes) render as `(no access)`\n\nPart of #93.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:33Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":97,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Procs: detail pane"}
